  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to Yemen Humanitarian Pooled Fund</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The YHPF is a key funding mechanism that provides rapid support to NGOs and UN agencies to meet priority humanitarian needs in Yemen. It allows the UN to allocate funding in a co-ordinated and prioritised manner in line with the 2016 UN Humanitarian Response Plan.</narrative>
  </description>
